WEBVTT

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.226
But on the inside, I'm really English,
so everybody irritates me.

00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:05.917
(Laughter)

00:02:08.208 --> 00:02:09.476
It's true.

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:13.018
And the thing is,
my family are Arab from Yemen,

00:02:13.042 --> 00:02:16.643
and I knew that that channel,

00:02:16.667 --> 00:02:18.059
Bab-el-Mandeb,

00:02:18.083 --> 00:02:20.809
is not that much of a feat to cross.

00:02:20.833 --> 00:02:24.601
And I kept asking myself
this really simple question:

00:02:24.625 --> 00:02:30.059
if the ancestors to New World monkeys
could somehow cross the Atlantic Ocean,